640 R0\nSYMATTR InstName Rt\nSYMATTR Value 20k\nTEXT 96 -48 Left 2 ;3-bit flash ADC: a ladder of 8 equal resistors divides Vref in 8 steps (tap k = k · Vref / 8), and 7 comparators\\ncompare vin with every tap at the same time. Their outputs t7 … t1 are a thermometer code (all ones below vin,\\nzeros above): FLASHENC.v turns it into binary and registers it on each clock edge (5 MS/s).\\nAn n-bit flash needs 2^n resistors and 2^n − 1 comparators: fast (one clock per sample) but expensive.\nTEXT 1280 432 Left 2 ;R-2R DAC, only to see the code\\nas a voltage: dac = 5 V · d / 8\nTEXT 64 704 Left 2 !.tran 10.5u\n",
